        "excluded_behaviors": ["liveness/fairness", "crash/recovery", "external side effects", "real DB/FS semantics"],
        "liveness": "NOT_CHECKED"
      },
      "assumptions": [
        "本协议是 S8 #314 设计拟议；实现状态 NOT_ASSESSED",
        "Claim 的互斥检查为设计义务，非真实源码证据",
        "StaleArrival 对状态变量不产生效果是设计要求"
